# litert-android-boilerplate — Cursor Rules

## Stack (Pinned — Do Not Change)
- Kotlin 2.0.21, AGP 8.7.3, Compose BOM 2024.12.01
- Min SDK 26, Target/Compile SDK 35
- LiteRT: com.google.ai.edge.litert:litert:1.4.0
- LiteRT GPU: com.google.ai.edge.litert:litert-gpu:1.2.0
- LiteRT-LM: com.google.ai.edge.litertlm:litertlm-android:latest.release
- QNN: com.qualcomm.qti:qnn-litert-delegate:2.44.0
- Hilt 2.51.1, Coroutines 1.8.1, Room 2.6.1

## Code Rules
- No TODO, no placeholder, no stub, no NotImplementedError
- No file longer than 300 lines — split if approaching limit
- Every public function has KDoc (what, params, returns, throws)
- Type hints everywhere — no raw Any, no unsafe casts
- Error handling on every I/O, delegate init, and inference call
- No hardcoded strings — use AppConfig or string resources

## Architecture
- MVVM + Repository + Hilt DI
- inference/ → classical ML only (InterpreterApi)
- inference-lm/ → LLM only (LiteRT-LM Engine)
- app/ → UI, DI wiring, config (replace when forking)
- Tools → tools/conversion/working/ (proven) or tools/conversion/experimental/ (risky, labeled)

## LiteRT Interpreter API — Correct
```kotlin
import com.google.ai.edge.litert.InterpreterApi
val interpreter = InterpreterApi.create(modelBuffer, options)
```

## LiteRT Interpreter API — FORBIDDEN
```kotlin
import org.tensorflow.lite.Interpreter  // OLD namespace — do not use
```

## LiteRT-LM API — Correct
```kotlin
val config = EngineConfig(modelPath = "/absolute/path.litertlm", backend = ...)
val engine = Engine(config)
val conversation = engine.createConversation()
val flow: Flow<Message> = conversation.sendMessageAsync("prompt")
```

## LiteRT-LM API — FORBIDDEN
```kotlin
Engine.createFromOptions(...)          // does not exist
EngineConfig.Builder()                 // does not exist
engine.createSession(...)              // deprecated
conversation.addQueryChunk(...)        // deprecated
modelPath = "assets://..."             // not supported by LM engine
```

## Delegate Priority (enforce in this order)
1. QNN NPU — Backend.NPU(nativeLibraryDir) or QnnDelegateFactory
2. GPU — GpuDelegateFactory() / Backend.GPU()
3. CPU/XNNPACK — always the final fallback

## NNAPI
- NOT included. Deprecated in Android 15. Do not add.

## QNN .so Files
- libs/qnn/arm64-v8a/ — not committed to git
- SM8550 (Snapdragon 8 Gen 2): needs libQnnHtpV73Stub.so, libQnnHtpV73Skel.so
- Must use useLegacyPackaging = true in packagingOptions

## Model Files
- .tflite → assets/models/ (< 100 MB) or absolute device path
- .litertlm → absolute device path ONLY (no assets:// support)
- *.tflite, *.litertlm, *.onnx, *.gguf → in .gitignore, never commit

## File Globs
- `inference/src/main/**/*.kt` → inference module source
- `inference-lm/src/main/**/*.kt` → LM module source
- `app/src/main/**/*.kt` → app source (replace when forking)
- `**/*Test.kt` → test files
- `gradle/libs.versions.toml` → version catalog (all dep versions live here)

## Tests
- Every public function → unit test in src/test/
- Every delegate path → unit test with mock
- Run: ./gradlew :inference:test :inference-lm:test

## Commits
- Format: type(scope): description
- Types: feat, fix, test, docs, chore, refactor, perf
- Scopes: inference, inference-lm, app, tools, ci, deps
